He loved his work so much.

1053
01:35:15.020 --> 01:35:17.850
He loved being there, everybody loved him.

1054
01:35:20.602 --> 01:35:22.300
So I stayed.

1055
01:35:23.134 --> 01:35:25.493
Same town, same house.

1056
01:35:30.600 --> 01:35:33.063
Just like my dad used to say.

1057
01:35:33.350 --> 01:35:35.600
What's remembered lives.

1058
01:35:39.250 --> 01:35:44.615
I maybe spent too much
of my life just remembering, Bob,

1059
01:35:46.320 --> 01:35:48.470
- you know what I mean?
- I can.

1060
01:35:49.300 --> 01:35:50.865
I can relate.

1061
01:35:51.520 --> 01:35:55.320
I rarely ever talk about my son.

1062
01:35:55.950 --> 01:35:58.620
But today would be

1063
