today would be his 33rd birthday and

1064
01:36:07.450 --> 01:36:09.980
five years ago, he took his life.

1065
01:36:14.520 --> 01:36:17.320
And I can still barely
say that in a sentence.

1066
01:36:21.370 --> 01:36:23.550
And, and for a long time

1067
01:36:25.770 --> 01:36:27.650
everyday

1068
01:36:29.850 --> 01:36:31.450
the question was

1069
01:36:32.470 --> 01:36:35.720
how can I be alive on
this Earth, when he's not?

1070
01:36:37.950 --> 01:36:39.770
And I didn't have any answer.

1071
01:36:41.300 --> 01:36:43.350
And those were some hard hard days.

1072
01:36:45.850 --> 01:36:47.350
But.

1073
01:36:48.970 --> 01:36:50.570
I realized that.

1074
01:36:51.970 --> 01:36:54.050
I could honor him by

1075
01:36:55.670 --> 01:36:58.250
