1080
01:37:12.750 --> 01:37:15.570
And lot of them
don't get over it either.

1081
01:37:15.870 --> 01:37:17.671
And that's okay.

1082
01:37:19.050 --> 01:37:20.992
That's OK.

1083
01:37:21.870 --> 01:37:24.750
One of the thing that I
love most about this life

1084
01:37:25.820 --> 01:37:27.320
is that

1085
01:37:27.350 --> 01:37:29.046
there is no final goodbye.

1086
01:37:29.070 --> 01:37:32.196
You know, I've met hundreds
of people out here and

1087
01:37:32.220 --> 01:37:34.370
